DOCUMENT();
loadMacros('PGstandard.pl', 'MathObjects.pl', 'PGcourse.pl');
TEXT(beginproblem());
$showPartialCorrectAnswers = 0;
$prompt = <<'PROMPT_F43E_1DB4';
<p>f43e_1db4</p> <p>A mutant screen was carried out to produce the diagram below. The diagram shows different classes&nbsp;(1-4) of mutants for metabolic precursors&nbsp;(W-Z) of a metabolic pathway to produce a product were characterized to either grow&nbsp;(+) or not grow&nbsp;(&ndash;) in minimal media.</p><table width="300px" cellpadding="2" cellspacing="2" style="text-align:center; border: 1px solid black; font-size: 14px;"><tr><td></td><td align="center" valign="middle">W</td><td align="center" valign="middle">X</td><td align="center" valign="middle">Y</td><td align="center" valign="middle">Z</td></tr><tr><td align="center" valign="middle">Class 1</td><td align="center" valign="middle">+</td><td align="center" valign="middle">&ndash;</td><td align="center" valign="middle">&ndash;</td><td align="center" valign="middle">+</td></tr><tr><td align="center" valign="middle">Class 2</td><td align="center" valign="middle">&ndash;</td><td align="center" valign="middle">&ndash;</td><td align="center" valign="middle">&ndash;</td><td align="center" valign="middle">+</td></tr><tr><td align="center" valign="middle">Class 3</td><td align="center" valign="middle">+</td><td align="center" valign="middle">+</td><td align="center" valign="middle">&ndash;</td><td align="center" valign="middle">+</td></tr><tr><td align="center" valign="middle">Class 4</td><td align="center" valign="middle">+</td><td align="center" valign="middle">+</td><td align="center" valign="middle">+</td><td align="center" valign="middle">+</td></tr></table><h6>Write the metabolic precursors&nbsp;(W-Z) in their correct order for the pathway without spaces or dashes. For example, ZYWX.</h6>
PROMPT_F43E_1DB4
sub fib_any_cmp {
  my @accepted = @_;
  return scalar str_cmp($accepted[0]) if @accepted == 1;
  my @checks = map { scalar str_cmp($_) } @accepted;
  my $combined = new AnswerEvaluator;
  $combined->ans_hash(correct_ans => join(' OR ', @accepted), type => 'fib_any_cmp', score => 0);
  $combined->install_evaluator(sub {
    my $rh_ans = shift;
    my $result;
    for my $check (@checks) {
      my $candidate = $check->evaluate($rh_ans->{student_ans});
      $result = defined($result) ? $result->OR($candidate) : $candidate;
    }
    return $result;
  });
  return $combined;
}
@accepted_fib = ("YXWZ");
TEXT(MODES(HTML => $prompt, TeX => ''));
BEGIN_TEXT
\{ans_rule(30)\}
END_TEXT
ANS(fib_any_cmp(@accepted_fib));

ENDDOCUMENT();
